---
/**
 * The star in front of a card's star count, outlined like GitHub's own unstarred button. Same
 * stroke style as the docs icon. Decorative: the link around it carries the accessible name.
 */
---

<svg
	class="icon"
	viewBox="0 0 24 24"
	fill="none"
	stroke="currentColor"
	stroke-width="1.8"
	stroke-linejoin="round"
	aria-hidden="true"
	focusable="false"
>
	<path d="M12 3.6 14.6 9.1 20.5 9.9 16.2 14.1 17.3 20 12 17.2 6.7 20 7.8 14.1 3.5 9.9 9.4 9.1 Z"
	></path>
</svg>

<style>
	.icon {
		display: block;
		flex: none;
		width: var(--icon-sm);
		height: var(--icon-sm);
	}
</style>
